  "description_en": "An orchestration template defines and describes a set of Kubernetes cluster resources in a declarative manner, specifying how applications should run or be configured. You can call the DescribeTemplates operation to retrieve a list of created orchestration templates and query detailed information about the templates, including access permissions, YAML content, and tags",
